[{"sha":"a24e868665e113b543572036bc9636768ed342c5","node_id":"C_kwDOAEML1NoAKGEyNGU4Njg2NjVlMTEzYjU0MzU3MjAzNmJjOTYzNjc2OGVkMzQyYzU","commit":{"author":{"name":"Tim Bates","email":"timothy.c.bates@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-12T06:57:14Z"},"committer":{"name":"Tim Bates","email":"timothy.c.bates@gmail.com","date":"2026-06-12T06:57:14Z"},"message":"Add WLS reference-model support and summary fixes (#297)\n\nAdd a generateReferenceModels method for MxFitFunctionWLS and thread the chosen fit function into generateNormalReferenceModels so saturated and independence reference models use the correct WLS fit function and handling (including special handling of means/ordinal data). Update mxRefModels to avoid disabling SE/Hessian for WLS models. Fix summary/ref-likelihood extraction to use output$chi when fitUnits indicate WLS-style fit units. Include new tests and scratch scripts (inst/models/passing/WlsRefModelsTest.R and several scratch/* WLS checks) to validate WLS reference models and summary metrics.","tree":{"sha":"a40d541d36db6c4ae4d1aca4026189e414b33731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenMx/OpenMx/git/trees/a40d541d36db6c4ae4d1aca4026189e414b33731"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenMx/OpenMx/git/commits/a24e868665e113b543572036bc9636768ed342c5","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenMx/OpenMx/commits/a24e868665e113b543572036bc9636768ed342c5","html_url":"https://github.com/OpenMx/OpenMx/commit/a24e868665e113b543572036bc9636768ed342c5","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/OpenMx/OpenMx/commits/a24e868665e113b543572036bc9636768ed342c5/comments","author":{"login":"tbates","id":736156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNjE1Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/736156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tbates","html_url":"https://github.com/tbates","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tb